# Energy Forecasting

Hourly energy consumption forecasting using machine learning and time-series validation.

## Project Overview

The goal of the project is to forecast hourly energy consumption from historical time-series data and evaluate the model using validation methods appropriate for temporal data.

The project focuses on:

* time-series exploratory data analysis;
* feature engineering;
* baseline comparison;
* gradient boosting;
* time-series cross-validation;
* backtesting;
* error analysis;
* overfitting and robustness checks.

## Dataset

The dataset contains hourly energy consumption observations.

Time period:

* **Start:** 2004-10-01
* **End:** 2018-08-03
* **Missing values:** 0

The data was sorted chronologically before model training and evaluation.

