## Key Takeaways

The project demonstrates a complete machine-learning workflow for a temporal forecasting problem:

**EDA → baseline → feature engineering → model training → evaluation → time-series cross-validation → backtesting → error analysis → robustness check.**

The final gradient boosting model significantly outperformed the naive previous-hour baseline while maintaining stable performance across multiple temporal validation folds.
